WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.772
All of us spend so 
much of our lives

00:00:01.772 --> 00:00:03.622
trying&nbsp;to make our 
future selves happy.

00:00:03.622 --> 00:00:06.589
We don't stop to ask, "Is it 
possible that in 20 or 30&nbsp;years,

00:00:06.589 --> 00:00:08.000
our future selves are 
going to ask us,

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.128
"What made you possibly think 
that that is what&nbsp;I would want?".

00:00:11.128 --> 00:00:13.391
We don't imagine, fundamentally,
 that we're going to have

00:00:13.391 --> 00:00:15.290
a different outlook or
a different perspective,

00:00:15.290 --> 00:00:17.471
that we're going to be different people.

00:00:17.471 --> 00:00:19.440
If you accept the idea that you're 
going&nbsp;to be a different person

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:20.651
in 30 years' time,

00:00:20.651 --> 00:00:22.439
you should play an active role

00:00:22.439 --> 00:00:24.914
crafting the person&nbsp;you 
are going to become.

00:00:24.914 --> 00:00:26.895
You should be the curator 
of your future self.

00:00:26.895 --> 00:00:28.365
You should be the architect.

00:00:28.365 --> 00:00:30.206
Expand your horizons,

00:00:30.206 --> 00:00:32.131
because you're going to become 
someone different,

00:00:32.131 --> 00:00:33.829
you might as well be in&nbsp;
charge of deciding

00:00:33.829 --> 00:00:35.368
who that person is going to be.

